# Implementation Plan - Deepen LMS Features

This plan outlines the creation of "deep" pages to simulate the actual learning and assessment experience, moving beyond just high-level dashboards.

## Goal Description
Create the functional "inner" pages of the LMS where the actual learning happens: inside a course, taking a quiz, and submitting work.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> I will continue using the Student Persona "Mohamed Osman" for consistency.

## Proposed Changes

I will create the following files in `ui_prototype/`:

#### [NEW] ui_prototype/course-detail.html
*   **Sidebar**: Updated to show course-specific context (Syllabus, Modules, Grades, People).
*   **Module View**: Accordion list of Week 1, Week 2, etc.
*   **Content Viewer**: Embedded video placeholder and download links.

#### [NEW] ui_prototype/quiz-interface.html
*   **Focus Mode**: Minimalist header (simulating the "Exam Shield" or a standard quiz).
*   **Question Types**: Multiple choice, True/False.
*   **Timer**: Visual countdown.
*   **Sidebar**: Question navigator.

#### [NEW] ui_prototype/assignment.html
*   **Brief**: Instructions and rubric view.
*   **Submission Box**: Drag-and-drop zone and text editor mock.

#### [NEW] ui_prototype/settings.html
*   **Profile**: Edit photo, change password.
*   **Notifications**: Toggle Email/SMS alerts.

### Updates
#### [MODIFY] ui_prototype/styles.css
*   Add styles for `accordion`, `quiz-options`, `submission-zone`, and `toggle-switch`.

